  "limitations": [
    "Local features retain spatial grid position:feature0 is pooled4x4x4 to64 channels at8x8x8 cells, while the global control averages the same full64x32x32x32 map. Both fit65 parameters including an intercept.",
    "This tests two fixed linear readouts of one frozen feature map. It does not exhaustively test current GTA head representations, nonlinear global heads or all possible global conditions.",
    "Local pooled features already contain broader convolutional receptive fields and SE/context information; local does not mean CT context is confined to16mm.",
    "The global readout is constant across cells within each patch by construction. Its within-patch correlation is mathematically undefined; tiny numeric centering residuals are not evidence of local information. This diagnostic correlation is intentionally not projected.",
    "All21,479 original adequately supported boundary cells are retained, including cells without Lee nodes. Unsupported cells are not imputed or interpreted as background or failure.",
    "GT defines evaluated supports and B targets. Only CT enters the frozen classifier, but ability to find valid boundary supports without GT has not been tested.",
    "The old backbone saw TRAIN36 and these data have development reuse; probe12 is held out only from the current analytical OLS fit. This is not blind-case, zero-shot, causal, significant or clinical evidence.",
    "Primary results are raw unclipped MSE. Clipped MSE and out-of-range fractions are secondary diagnostics, not a selected replacement metric.",
    "Overlapping cells/patches are not independent observations; cases, then supported patches, then cells receive equal weight. No neural training, GTA consumer change or adoption follows automatically."
